  "question": "For the historical requirements relevant to the current client task, reconstruct their last valid state immediately before the current task. Do not apply the current task to that state.",
  "target_task": {
    "source_message_id": 16,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Mutfakları ayrı odalar yapmak yerine doğrudan açık salon konseptine dahil edelim ve mevcut duvarları olabildiğince aynı tutalım. Her ev için 240cm uzunluğunda hem üst hem de alt dolap yeterlidir."
  },
  "history_pool": {
    "boundary": "STRICTLY_BEFORE_TARGET_MESSAGE",
    "contains_target_message": false,
    "message_count": 15,
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The picture shows two toilet tubing. Given those pictured conditions, where would you position the bathrooms and kitchen cabinets?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "A simple pencil drawing will be enough to communicate the general idea, so please do not spend too much time on the first draft. Could you indicate the positions of the 3 new bathrooms, the 3 new kitchen cabinets, and the separation walls, including how you would divide the houses?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The plan now contains sketches prepared from the supplied information, with our initial analyses presented in the image. If the work is approved, we will complete the remaining analyses and produce the digital plan file using Autocad.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "For the open-concept living rooms, how are you planning to handle the kitchen cabinets?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Once the project is awarded, we'd be glad to develop all remaining design details. Contract approval will allow us to finish the detailed design, AutoCAD plans, and visuals by next Thursday.\nThank you for your interest.\nBests,",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Could you provide your mobile phone details so I can send the item directly through the phone?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Until the contract is in place, I'd prefer that our communication remain here on Upwork rather than move to a mobile phone. What exactly would you like to send? Any files or information can be shared through Upwork. Thank you for understanding.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Because they charge a 65 dolar commission for a 120 dolar payment, I would prefer to send the payment directly through iban.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Since we connected through Upwork, I would rather keep the payment on Upwork instead of moving it off-platform. That follows the platform's policy and protects both parties, although I understand your concern.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "I'm sorry you're going through that.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I'd be happy to work with you if you decide to proceed through Upwork, so there is no problem on my side.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "All right, please proceed with developing the details for the kitchen cabinets.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The offer has now been sent, so you are authorized to start the work immediately.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "A quick sketch showing our initial layout idea is being sent now. Tomorrow morning, I'll follow it with a more carefully planned and refined layout. Thank you—we're excited to work on the project.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Do you have the existing floor plan in DWG format? Having that digital floor plan would help me prepare a more accurate layout.",
        "milestone": null
      }
    ]
  },
